  "name": "Post Veo 3.1 videos from Telegram to TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "76d7cd58-ab8c-4e8d-aa8b-9a91952237d1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -657,
        -97
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 762,
        "content": "## Post Veo 3.1 videos from a Telegram message\nSend an idea to your Telegram bot and get a finished AI video on TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts. Gemini plans it, Veo 3.1 renders it, PostWire posts it with a caption per network.\n\n### How it works\n1. **New idea in Telegram** takes any text message sent to your bot (commands are skipped) and the bot replies that the render started.\n2. **Plan the video with Gemini** returns the Veo prompt, a caption for each network and the YouTube title.\n3. **Generate the clip with Veo 3.1** renders 8 seconds in 9:16 and the file goes straight to a PostWire upload slot.\n4. **Send the clip to the chat** shows you the video and **Publish with PostWire** posts it with each network's text and the AI-generated label on TikTok and YouTube. A retry never posts twice.\n5. Every video is logged in Google Sheets, and the bot replies with the links or the exact fix for each network that refused.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a free account at postwire.io, connect your networks and copy your API key. In n8n add a **Header Auth** credential (name `Authorization`, value `Bearer pw_live_\u2026`) and select it in the three PostWire nodes.\n2. Create a bot with @BotFather and select its Telegram credential in the five Telegram nodes. In the trigger, restrict the bot to your chat ID so nobody else spends your Veo credits.\n3. Add a Google Gemini credential with billing enabled (about one dollar per 8-second Veo 3.1 Fast clip).\n4. Create a sheet with the columns date, idea, status, links and note, and pick it in both Sheets nodes.\n\n### Customize\nEdit the networks in Read the plan or the style in the Gemini system message."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
