          "systemMessage": "You plan one 8-second vertical (9:16) video for short-form social media. Return JSON with the keys veo_prompt (one paragraph for Veo: subject, action, camera movement, lighting, ambient sound; no on-screen text, no logos, no real people), tiktok (a hook of up to 150 characters with 3 hashtags), instagram (2 sentences and up to 5 hashtags), youtube_title (a searchable title of up to 90 characters), youtube (a 2-sentence description), linkedin (2 short professional paragraphs) and facebook (1 or 2 conversational sentences)."
